   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why pick Claude Platform on AWS anyway: the full Claude API on day one (Skills, code execution, web search, batches, Managed Agents), billed on the AWS invoice.\nWhy pick Bedrock: AWS as the only data processor, AU residency, and AWS compliance programs. Our read: ANZ regulated customers usually land here.",
   "originalText": "Why pick Claude Platform on AWS anyway: the full Claude API on day one (Skills, code execution, web search, batches, Managed Agents), billed on the AWS invoice.\nWhy pick Bedrock: AWS as the only data processor, AU residency, and AWS compliance programs. Our read: ANZ regulated customers usually land here.",
   "fontSize": 17,
